CP1400/CP1500/Netra-T1 users,

I've written a short platform support document that
describes the features available on these boardsets
and how they can be used.

Jim has kindly agreed to host this document at:

	http://www.ultralinux.org/CP1X00.html

The Netra-T1 is almost identical to the CP1500, but
I have none with which to test.  If you have access
to a Netra-T1 and can confirm/deny the information
is correct, please contact me and I can give you
a few test programs to exercise the drivers.

